// Stealth transfers: ring-signature + Bulletproofs+ private transfers.
// The date below is a PLACEHOLDER; the real activation date is set by the
// committee when the feature is scheduled for a particular network.
//
// CORRECTION 2026-10-07: this header previously said "Placeholder activation
// flag only -- gates nothing yet." That was FALSE and dangerously reassuring.
// The flag gates the entire stealth feature: 18 direct HARDFORK_STEALTH_PASSED
// sites plus 22 stealth_passed() call sites (the evaluator wrapper) gate ops,
// objects, shared fee routing, the maintenance sweeps, the fee schedule, and the
// proposal-operation hardfork visitor. Before it passes, every stealth-gated
// path stays rejected, so no node can produce a block a pre-fork node cannot
// validate -- that fail-closed property is exactly why the flag is load-bearing.
// Do not read "placeholder" as "inert".
#ifndef HARDFORK_STEALTH_TIME
#define HARDFORK_STEALTH_TIME (fc::time_point_sec( 1893456000 )) // 2030-01-01T00:00:00Z
#define HARDFORK_STEALTH_PASSED(now) (now >= HARDFORK_STEALTH_TIME)
#endif
